[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "アルビちゃん一行、ただいま戻りましたー！\nみんなー！　聞いて聞いて！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "あら、やけに機嫌いいじゃない。\nどうしたのよ？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "アタシたち、神聖国から長期休暇もらったんだー！\nこれまでの功績が評価されてね！　しかも――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 3101416597918110218,
    "text": "ゼレンタ島へ招待されたわ。\n往復乗船券と宿泊券もバッチリ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5045460652135134961,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "ゼレンタ島……諸島同盟指折りの行楽地ですね！\n海がとても綺麗だと本で読みました",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 1819147851487138677,
    "text": "ええ。それで、その話なんだけど、\n私たちの他にも何人か招待していいって話なの",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6181229795949782132,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 1819147851487138677,
    "text": "もしよかったら、あなたたちも一緒にどうかしら？\nイザナさんたちも誘ってくれて大丈夫よ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6181229795949782132,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 6823802507187778884,
    "text": "わぁ……！　いいんですか！！\nぜひ同行させてください！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "私たちもロマンから休みをもらったばかりなのよ。\nちょうどよかったわ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "ひゃっほーい！　みんなで旅行だー！！\nたっくさん遊ぶぞー！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 3101416597918110218,
    "text": "ひゃっふー",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5045460652135134961,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "あ、そうだ。ベップは水着持ってないよね。\n一緒に買いに行こっか！　ヤンネさんは持ってる？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 1819147851487138677,
    "text": "私？　持っていないけれど……私はいいわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6181229795949782132,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 3101416597918110218,
    "text": "どうして？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5045460652135134961,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 1819147851487138677,
    "text": "もういい歳だもの。それに大人として、\nあなたたちのことを監督する責任があるから",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6181229795949782132,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "水着を着るのに歳なんか関係ない！\nヤンネさんも一緒に水着着て、海で遊ぼうよ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 1819147851487138677,
    "text": "うーん……でも……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6181229795949782132,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "……水着のほうがいいと思うけどな～。\n着衣だと、海の中で何かあったときに対処しづらいよ？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 1819147851487138677,
    "text": "それはそうね……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6181229795949782132,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 3101416597918110218,
    "text": "ヤンネさん、一緒に水着着て遊ぼう？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5045460652135134961,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 1819147851487138677,
    "text": "……もう、分かったわ。\n二人とも、一緒に水着選んでくれる？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6181229795949782132,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 2668606804942549205,
    "text": "もちろんっすわ！\nそんじゃ早速買いに行こう！　ベップ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 3101416597918110218,
    "text": "御意！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5045460652135134961,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "localized_name": "キューン",
    "romanized_name": "Quinn",
    "model_path_hash": 913274709521753211,
    "text": "海の綺麗な島で休暇かぁ……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7374237645965483172,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "……キューン、行きたい？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "localized_name": "キューン",
    "romanized_name": "Quinn",
    "model_path_hash": 913274709521753211,
    "text": "うん。でも私たちは招待されてないから……。\nみんなで遊ぶの楽しそう……いいなぁ……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7374237645965483172,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "じゃあ、キューンとヤドヴィガも一緒に行きましょ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "localized_name": "キューン",
    "romanized_name": "Quinn",
    "model_path_hash": 913274709521753211,
    "text": "え、いいの！？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7374237645965483172,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "ダメなわけないじゃない。\nきっとアルビーナたちもいいって言ってくれるわよ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "localized_name": "キューン",
    "romanized_name": "Quinn",
    "model_path_hash": 913274709521753211,
    "text": "やったぁ！！　行く行く！！\nヤド姉も行くよね！？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7374237645965483172,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "……キューンが行くなら",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 8455227271865371244,
    "text": "それじゃあ決まりね！\nみんなで最高の休暇にするわよっ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "localized_name": "キューン",
    "romanized_name": "Quinn",
    "model_path_hash": 913274709521753211,
    "text": "おー！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7374237645965483172,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ・ジムロック",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina Zimlock",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "「星の案内人」兼、錬金術士の少女。\n所属するノーヴァ神聖国に呼び出されていた",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "記憶喪失の戦士にして、錬金術士。\nランターナ王国から休みをもらい、くつろいでいた",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6891392099494261238,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "localized_name": "ベップ・ジムロック",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp Zimlock",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "ノーヴァ神聖国で聖戦士を務める少女。\n義姉のアルビーナと共に、神聖国に呼び出されていた",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5045460652135134961,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "localized_name": "レスナ・シュテルネンリヒト",
    "romanized_name": "Resna Sternenlicht",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "錬金術を愛する、腕利きの錬金術士。\nランターナ王国から休みをもらい、くつろいでいた",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 2457375212832216718,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ・リンデマン",
    "romanized_name": "Janne Lindemann",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "ノーヴァ神聖国の聖戦士にして、１児の母。\nアルビーナ、ベップと共に、神聖国に呼び出されていた",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6181229795949782132,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "localized_name": "キューン",
    "romanized_name": "Quinn",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "ヴァレリアの妹で、９人兄弟の末っ子。\n控えめな性格で、少し人見知り",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7374237645965483172,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "ヴァレリアの妹で、９人兄弟の８番目。\n主に忠実で、下された命令を無駄なく実行する",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  }
]